        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "As a result, we believe that the diversification of our business in these complementary markets positions us to benefit from the expected long‑term investment associated with these developments.",
        "start_character": 9679,
        "end_character": 9873
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0000015615-26-000020",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0000015615-26-000020-80c706fe06e6efc2",
        "accession_number": "0000015615-26-000020",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "As one of the largest providers of communications infrastructure services, we believe that we are well-positioned to benefit from the expected opportunities in the telecommunications market as previously described.",
        "start_character": 16101,
        "end_character": 16315
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0000015615-26-000020",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0000015615-26-000020-80c706fe06e6efc2",
        "accession_number": "0000015615-26-000020",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Through our Clean Energy and Infrastructure segment, we provide engineering, procurement and construction services and project management solutions to the power market, with services across wind, solar, biofuels, waste-to-energy (WtE) and biogas, cogeneration or combined heat and power projects, gas and hydrogen-fired power projects, battery storage and other clean energy technologies.",
        "start_character": 44631,
        "end_character": 45019
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0000015615-26-000020",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0000015615-26-000020-80c706fe06e6efc2",
        "accession_number": "0000015615-26-000020",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Through our unified MasTec® brand and an integrated organizational structure designed to permit rapid deployment of our services, we are able to quickly and efficiently allocate resources to meet customer needs.",
        "start_character": 76984,
        "end_character": 77195
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0000015615-26-000020",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0000015615-26-000020-80c706fe06e6efc2",
        "accession_number": "0000015615-26-000020",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We also have expertise in environmental remediation services, including site development, environmental site closure and coal combustion residuals management services.",
        "start_character": 54061,
        "end_character": 54228
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0000015615-26-000020",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0000015615-26-000020-80c706fe06e6efc2",
        "accession_number": "0000015615-26-000020",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We also provide certain other services.",
        "start_character": 68022,
        "end_character": 68061
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0000015615-26-000020",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0000015615-26-000020-80c706fe06e6efc2",
        "accession_number": "0000015615-26-000020",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We also provide electrical grid hardening services in several regions of the country to reduce the risk of storm outages caused by damage to overhead power lines during a storm.",
        "start_character": 52802,
        "end_character": 52979
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0000015615-26-000020",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0000015615-26-000020-80c706fe06e6efc2",
        "accession_number": "0000015615-26-000020",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We also provide emergency restoration services following natural disasters and accidents, and we perform environmental planning, compliance and remediation.",
        "start_character": 69361,
        "end_character": 69517
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0000015615-26-000020",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0000015615-26-000020-80c706fe06e6efc2",
        "accession_number": "0000015615-26-000020",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We also provide heavy civil infrastructure construction services, including the construction and maintenance of buildings, roads, bridges, rail, water/sewer systems and other civil infrastructure, including data center infrastructure.",
        "start_character": 21709,
        "end_character": 21943
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0000015615-26-000020",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0000015615-26-000020-80c706fe06e6efc2",
        "accession_number": "0000015615-26-000020",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We also provide wildfire mitigation services, including grid hardening and power line undergrounding, whereby power lines are buried in areas considered to be at high risk for fires.",
        "start_character": 52619,
        "end_character": 52801
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0000015615-26-000020",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0000015615-26-000020-80c706fe06e6efc2",
        "accession_number": "0000015615-26-000020",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We also work with our customers to design and build innovative, smart energy solutions, including projects to digitize, modernize, secure and harden the grid, including from the potential effects of extreme and intensifying weather events, wildfire mitigation and restoration services and the upgrade of aging and overstressed electric infrastructure.",
        "start_character": 47316,
        "end_character": 47667
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0000015615-26-000020",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0000015615-26-000020-80c706fe06e6efc2",
        "accession_number": "0000015615-26-000020",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We are able to respond quickly and effectively to industry, market and technological changes, demand and major weather and/or climate-related events by allocating our employees, fleet and other assets as and where they are needed, enabling us to provide cost-effective and timely services for our customers.",
